
Step-1  Create 2 EC2 instance  and make sure that both machine running under the same security Group ( Firewall )
			
		If you first EC2 instance running -> launch-wizard-1 
		then second machine must select above security group.
		
	Note:  open port number 80 inboud rule of security group 
						
Step-2  Install apache and Nginx seperately on each machine

			server1  -  nginx
			server2  -  apache (httpd)
			
		Note:  test each node before create any TG
			
Step-3  Create Target Group
			( port number 80 )

Step-4  Create Application Load Balancer  ( https, http )
			
Step-5  Wait for some time or you can check on Domain propagation
		for test
		
Step-6  once you create LB you can cross check on browser
		
			https://www.whatsmydns.net/
